Error [E2713]: there is no comptime value named `missing`
  --> tests/ui/E2712_splice_outside_comptime.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     print($missing)
    |           ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `$name` splices a value that was computed by a `comptime` binding or `comptime {}` block
 Fix: define `comptime missing = ...` before using `$missing`
